[en.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_PURGE]
Umbrums’ Feast

[en.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_PURGE_desc]
The Umbrums feast on despair, and the heretics who know they are about to be purged are a prime source of despair.

[zh.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_PURGE]
影魔的盛宴

[zh.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_PURGE_desc]
影魔以绝望为食，而得知自己将要被清洗的异教徒则是绝望的最佳来源之一。
